  <category name="Notation">
    <reapack name="reaper_native_notator.lua" type="script" desc="REAPER Notator 3.3.5: Native Musical Notation &amp; Engraving Suite">
      <metadata>
        <description><![CDATA[REAPER Notator 3.3.5 (Exclusive Edition) — Proprietary native musical notation, score editing, and engraving environment for Cockos REAPER. Requires ReaImGui v0.10+ and Reaticulate. Includes Master Acoustic Studio VST3 ('Notator Acoustic Master', supported on Windows x64 and macOS Universal2 only — Linux not supported). Copyright (C) 2026 A-intheCode. All Rights Reserved.]]></description>
        <link rel="website">https://github.com/A-intheCode/ReaperNotator</link>
      </metadata>
      <version name="3.3.5" author="A-intheCode" time="2026-11-24T23:31:40Z">
        <changelog><![CDATA[
+ v3.3.5 — EdgeCase StaffPad MusicXML Import Fix & Unified Tie Consolidation:
  - EdgeCase StaffPad MusicXML import Fix: consolidated standard MusicXML <tie>/<tied> chains (cross-bar, syncopated & multi-bar) into unified continuous MIDI notes so Piano Roll, Velocity Lane & selection show single sustained notes while Score Canvas auto-generates bar ties
  - Added <tied type="continue"/>, case-insensitive tie parsing, tiered cross-voice / cross-staff & out-of-order <backup> tie resolution, plus tuplet-tie grid protection
  - Updated v3.3.5 User Manual (PDF)
        ]]></changelog>
